If you want to verify the live DB quickly, run:

  SELECT team_gid, user_gid, role, is_admin, typeof(is_admin)
  FROM team_members
  ORDER BY team_gid, user_gid;

  and then:

  SELECT team_gid, user_gid, role, is_admin
  FROM view_team_memberships
  ORDER BY team_gid, user_gid;

  If team_members has 0/1 but view_team_memberships shows NULL, then the view/schema is stale
  in that DB and needs to be rebuilt by re-running database.initialize(...) or resyncing with
  the current code.

